Python Version - Recommended Practices:

- Always check regime before trading 
- Use walk-forward analysis to validate strategies and avoid overfitting 
- Include transaction costs in all backtests 
- Size positions by volatility, not equal weight 
- Use trailing stops to lock in profits 
- Monitor drawdown continuously and respect limits 
- Rebalance factor portfolios monthly, not daily 
- Combine multiple factors for diversification
- Compare to benchmarks (buy-and-hold, equal-weight)
- Document all parameter changes for reproducibility 

